{"id":196,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Wields an arcane power with which it can predict the weather and even people's thoughts. When bathed in sunshine, the scarlet orb on its brow glows and builds energy."},{"games":["Shield","Moon"],"text":"It unleashes psychic power from the orb on its forehead. When its power is exhausted, the orb grows dull and dark."},{"games":["Sword","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"By reading air currents, it can predict things such as the weather or its foe’s next move."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Psychic power builds up in the orb on its forehead as it bathes in the sunshine. Espeon is not good at battling at night."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Although it originally had no powers at all, people say its precognitive faculties were awakened by its need to protect itself."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It can instantaneously sense its opponent’s movements by feeling air currents with its fine fur."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Espeon is extremely loyal to any Trainer it considers to be worthy. It is said that this Pokémon developed its precognitive powers to protect its Trainer from harm."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can feel minute shifts in the air and predict the weather...and its foes’ thoughts."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"The tip of its forked tail quivers when it is predicting its opponent’s next move."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can sense minute shifts in the air and predict the weather."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It uses the fine hair that covers its body to sense air currents and predict its enemy’s actions."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its fur has the look and feel of velvet. The orb on its forehead glows when it uses psycho-power."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"An ESPEON is extremely loyal to any TRAINER it considers to be worthy. It is said to have developed precognitive powers to protect its TRAINER from harm."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Synchronize","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is burned, paralyzed, or poisoned by another Pokémon, that Pokémon will be inflicted with the same status condition."},{"name":"Magic Bounce","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon reflects status moves instead of getting hit by them."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":35,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Purple","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":133,"name":"Eevee","condition":null,"children":[{"id":134,"name":"Vaporeon","condition":"Use Water Stone","children":[]},{"id":135,"name":"Jolteon","condition":"Use Thunder Stone","children":[]},{"id":136,"name":"Flareon","condition":"Use Fire Stone","children":[]},{"id":196,"name":"Espeon","condition":"Level up, High Friendship (Day)","children":[]},{"id":197,"name":"Umbreon","condition":"Level up, High Friendship (Night)","children":[]},{"id":470,"name":"Leafeon","condition":"Level up, near a special rock at Eterna Forest (or 4 other places) or Use Leaf Stone","children":[]},{"id":471,"name":"Glaceon","condition":"Level up, near a special rock at Route 217 (or 4 other places) or Use Ice Stone","children":[]},{"id":700,"name":"Sylveon","condition":"Level up, High Affection, knowing a Fairy move or Level up, High Friendship, knowing a Fairy move","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,93],[1,33],[1,36],[1,38],[1,39],[1,44],[1,45],[1,204],[1,226],[1,270],[1,343],[1,383],[5,28],[10,98],[15,608],[20,129],[25,60],[30,234],[35,384],[40,94],[45,244],[50,248],[55,387]],"machine":[914,226,34,347,204,109,174,605,91,38,577,203,797,263,313,248,416,447,356,270,63,304,286,113,345,189,408,182,60,244,94,706,917,678,473,240,115,156,46,247,285,214,500,164,241,129,36,851,86,885,271,433,311,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv8pt5-155","name":"Espeon ex","set":"Prismatic Evolutions","d